Green phase. `Project.replacing(_ pattern: Pattern, at:)` writes the Pattern
into that slot of the selected Bank, leaving the other fifteen and the other
Banks alone. The range guard is explicit here rather than delegated, because
`Bank.replacing(_:at:)` returning the Bank unchanged would still rebuild the
Project and the test asks for the same value back.

